
### One important change I made

I deliberately **didn't claim that YouTube/TikTok/Instagram publishing is already implemented**. They're now under the roadmap because your original README says those are future items.

Likewise, I separated:

**Completed → In Progress → Roadmap**

That makes the repository much more credible to a technical reviewer because they can immediately distinguish what you've actually built from what you're planning.

